d and acceleration"},{"j":"l","t":["Speed = distance ÷ time.","Acceleration = (final − initial velocity) ÷ time."]}]},{"id":"f2-mat-dlp-10","nama":"10. Gradient of a Straight Line","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Gradient"},{"j":"l","t":["m = (y₂ − y₁)/(x₂ − x₁).","y = mx + c: m is the gradient, c the y-intercept."]}]},{"id":"f2-mat-dlp-11","nama":"11. Isometric Transformations","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Transformations"},{"j":"l","t":["Translation (a, b): (x, y) → (x + a, y + b).","Reflection in x-axis: (x, −y); y-axis: (−x, y)."]}]},{"id":"f2-mat-dlp-12","nama":"12. Measures of Central Tendency","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Mean, median, mode"},{"j":"l","t":["Mean = total ÷ number of values.","Median: the middle of ordered data.","Mode: the most frequent value."]}]},{"id":"f2-mat-dlp-13","nama":"13. Simple Probability","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Probability"},{"j":"l","t":["P(A) = outcomes in A ÷ size of the sample space.","0 ≤ P(A) ≤ 1."]}]},{"id":"f2-mat-dlp-u1","nama":"End-of-Year Test (sample)","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Sample test"},{"j":"p","t":"52 questions from every chapter: easy to hard. Suggested time: 1 hour."}]}]}